{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822d8b5e7f03a03461a896adf145e0dcfc718c8dbff4056ee53ad2158ed5d9dc",
      "text": "目标是Jupiter第一的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5860054c0237eafaa78c85642e0138ebf764862bb1cfde435307e233d8ea16",
      "text": "男极“受欢迎部门”的比赛舞台是电视\n节目《成为万物的万人迷！》。Jupiter只要在\n这里大显身手，315 Pro就能离男极KING更近一步。\n于是冬马为了成为组合内最受欢迎的\n男人，向Beit寻求了建议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822d8b5e7f03a03461a896adf145e0dcfc718c8dbff4056ee53ad2158ed5d9dc",
      "text": "目标是Jupiter第一的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa56dcab2140547df5c06f5f347ca595edd7c1d30dbe41b49e0bb63fb9f325ad",
      "text": "啊——……怎么说呢，那件衣服挺好看的。\n所以，要不要跟我……唔……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09a81671b4d369f8c281cefa424f6578da26ed87cc995222ac167e2b1920e1f0",
      "text": "啊——！不行，耍帅耍得太生硬了！\n果然凭我还是赢不了北斗吗……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f71d827b29b1c408d879c7ccb0be6b40a30a40db941f76d98566be7b6cab942f",
      "text": "（明明要在下次出演的电视节目《成为万物的万人迷！》里，\n去撩观众的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340adff84d0f914cd9e9c2994a6fc19309172a63f18fca0100c0e0eae2e01fb7",
      "text": "（完全想不出好的台词，\n一点感觉都没有！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6328cd487769ac07eaa36555250ef8c0f7edc017293c89c98e8aab4783634a7",
      "text": "……听说节目的事前问卷里，大家都说\nJupiter里北斗绝对是第一名！来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac4d8f7c84a3b09cd20e8bdedbe40400d838af333a2c1f68abe512dcc63b2e96",
      "text": "但是只要多练习，就算是我也肯定能超越北斗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb4ec8cacf2247e33ace28a27727c3b0ef704e2d8be24303135067a43119036",
      "text": "（……而且，这个节目\n是和男极联赛的“受欢迎部门”联动的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e9e8f252303a8a934cf394d5c14ec625c5107849b913359b8b7b758c2a8ea1",
      "text": "（只要我们Jupiter表现优异，\n315 Pro就能更接近男极KING）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5455b60e9f627bd3b931fef091bb3dcc3fa429a55d1dd31b5c26f163edc5260",
      "text": "可不是犯怂的时候啊！但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fbace4f3e2121d304cea0477a6347dcd50da959195749fb20b10a30ecf0ea3",
      "text": "撩人的话到底要怎么才能想出来啊？\n眼前要是能有个对象的话或许会不一样吧……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:679c9b58d71e310c4176189a333d191120842a895607fdbafa399f67e509c3cc",
      "text": "……对了，就用这个吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9283dc995c8e17620695715d95b5d9dd790656c606e8cb70c173daf5d48152f0",
      "text": "这个站姿真帅啊！\n我从来没见过比你更帅气的机器人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4afa4298cf6b13e696ddaf5b537fad6ac3d59b9dfc2d8c8911782bfc34afc0ff",
      "text": "不管是表情还是外形，都帅得一塌糊涂。\n让人忍不住看入迷了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd38fbc087860c358a19b2e4e23341d86695da749dd3e4e07da03a84aad7219",
      "text": "……嘿嘿。果然面对中意的手办，\n感情就是容易投入啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0adf12631410f57e6d76ff2e695d4021480df857ebda310466be02ecc57e9c",
      "text": "话也能顺畅地说出来了，状态不错。\n接下来用这边这个试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1b26ebc4c87944e46039c7521c9e62b1ead67cd7d3272e7628a51d4afc5d959",
      "text": "……等等，都这个时间了？\n差不多该去洗澡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2f3708896d6306a5ab960c4eba099022bc19f6959d9e6fa9c4690e80a571ac",
      "text": "（只要继续对着手办练习，\n当天应该也能帅气地表现好吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000060:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2df22e5eebd558214763a9af8531804f0fa9e864683e3c668125f30b76f8d1df",
      "text": "（嗯。洗完澡嗓子感觉挺舒服的，\n把一开始没说好的那句台词再试一次吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a598581390d47784b0b1568a27e1882b71c6685102c00f0e41f4d0ac6445006",
      "text": "那件衣服挺可爱的，超级适合你哦！\n与其说是衣服，不如说是你很可爱……或者说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d4e2d4bd1372d63b5f461712bd1b35f53dabbf6f9d656815d75be3d8e49762d",
      "text": "（唔……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f903b050fd019771cad5c55e76c0e98d3f443c9e61562d4107781df1c3ce6a",
      "text": "（果然还是太难为情了……\n这样子当天真的能赢吗……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000115:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8b8444a2622d5cd1742b5c1ed7f6f555492d97ae1810d642ff1544aa2f2aff",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，突然打电话给你不好意思啊。\n……我有件事想拜托你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c54091f1aff235b3fee6e879db6100a2c456bfe3f70d26a923bbbfee804aa45",
      "text": "想请你去问问Beit的三个人，他们的“绝招粉丝福利”是什么。\n明天你会见他们对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000127:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afeadfb07d240658ad1846c1daa6293130ea09a056b4ce64cf52b5f2d186b068",
      "text": "是为了《成为万物的万人迷！》\n吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:362d5a87bf5426a13b5498c70cf5a2857d41c2f0c7412162ab65d1b47e7dd3a8",
      "text": "对。啊，顺便说一句，不用去问北斗啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2991f12be560c2d2458ccb581e39a868888d83f43d23c7be99631e0a7355ba34",
      "text": "虽然这种事是那家伙的强项，\n但我也不想输给他啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f47cdfa72ead32c41e43e01baf7610610a2ee393a1957b60c2b7c5243990477f",
      "text": "所以我自己在家里做了各种自主练习……\n但老实说，没什么底气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40e0c8b9b74f8da46c22fbab5fd9f1e25c3ffce1f6b92acaaec98b0e663b475d",
      "text": "Beit给人一种闪闪发光的王子般的感觉吧？\n所以我就想，能不能得到点建议呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000138:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000139:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9308b706e2d456c820fd8d48568e01473b68de36f9235b8dbd0094adff2cc5",
      "text": "我这就联系他们\n确认一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d58d3e8904bab062d3c1e3f23557b34c8a7243da1154bbfc6c393fb84f5f103b",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n那就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:592663f635343669353d5c542a92586a55e64cacd36c579211ad3384b7ee26cd",
      "text": "Beit的“绝招粉丝福利”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e18bc968294ed1f197097b9206f7448b7016830db1c71b0f5ea1368831d6fdc",
      "text": "是的。冬马先生说，\n想作为《成为万物的万人迷！》的参考。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd8050d34d861f89a3cc63cfa9d7e6e75df0df566614553fd837134303c510c",
      "text": "要是那个的话，我最喜欢恭二和实微笑了！\n是Beit的绝招！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911bea802e8c4c8329a3cc8367f403c3449dc3f9423bf97a6a65832280defc8e",
      "text": "谢谢你，皮埃尔。\n我也最喜欢皮埃尔的笑容了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a50293580b8159580588c953430f49bf33f16d1362cf896d35467afd89f810",
      "text": "还有，实的眨眼，恭二的飞吻！\n恭二最近练了好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c0fce1672b6bf7ad78cf5adf3508a6907a3456266a1e3bcee8db87ec2ba106",
      "text": "哎，毕竟是他们两个人教我的嘛。\n虽然我也不确定到底做得像不像样就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30add3ce053290067555a685b6ba95a61f861950b8625e7167844b7c5a5f8ae5",
      "text": "我……挺喜欢皮埃尔向粉丝挥手的动作呢。\n连带着我自己都会忍不住微笑起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d82116873b4dac832f1b2d5c2cb6f3cd1b5948fb2a63fea578395536e6130734",
      "text": "嗯嗯，我懂。那个笑容和挥手的姿态，\n能让人感受到只有皮埃尔才能展现出的高贵气质呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de92809d06bab32bf207fa05465a05a647247c0fb1f6bc452999748e08d13367",
      "text": "嘿嘿……谢谢。我会更加努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76b496c892a9a29de2c01b2817f25d9c347f6fc3173ee35dd79eec922e64c72",
      "text": "我觉得大家作为偶像，\n在这短短的时间里都有了很大的成长哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a8beee9967d7926532998cc23655c1204056c51f8ffba79ab3beced4602cdd",
      "text": "真的吗？谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:432179edc2abfda395f7ff141270386053af3d424b9b070f92f4387f4b95b1d5",
      "text": "冬马先生虽然来请教我们……\n但Jupiter也很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe465fbd977d51cfbea767ab35e96977f71554fd713220aa7af3f1942cd8d1f8",
      "text": "不管做什么都很帅气，\n过去的经验完全融入到了一举手一投足之中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949416446f9144a06a1ed56d9d244ebcebbab35b74204673929e66dcdff610ff",
      "text": "我看着Jupiter的时候，心里总是扑通扑通、非常兴奋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee93ba76e6e668fcfc627ca6e98fa2ac88ea65cef0c7df9b1bbd02ecbf1a4b86",
      "text": "对吧！片刻都无法移开视线的歌声与舞蹈，\n在恰到好处的时机送上的粉丝福利……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f668cb2230c4c13595383b02d7fb0fb6adbf50a005a7bb7f0b80ed2115d836eb",
      "text": "但这并没有结束。\n每一次看都在不断进化的表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a24e4d3c72331f195d9e7a2e736e9945ce6b72125eb5252cd652dd5c1438797",
      "text": "这样优秀的Jupiter三个人能在同一家事务所，\n而且还担任男极的先锋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd72bffaf5c49fc02eeb879c8a651edf15c5456379f1c6383bb467699649b4c9",
      "text": "真的很让人安心呢！啊……\n不好意思，我稍微有点太激动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc739fd5073b03c04de666dd2442d98f1c55764e0cff8cb35e5cc48fe382b20f",
      "text": "哎……我明白实先生想说什么。\nJupiter的表现力确实很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f281b37e079bc58aa5257a84351da6c7f132ed220de451b669d4791e5d131c6",
      "text": "就算在我们说话的期间，他们肯定也在继续进化着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4dbaf219d156aeef5df46a0d6c007cd768873b2456ecacceed1b93bd50648d",
      "text": "但是，Beit也不会认输的！\n那么，重新开始练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664bd28f64ce3acbde693e39b8efdd6bf5fc3bbf011e61a6cf23067464410680",
      "text": "我带了能在接下来的练习中用到的\n超棒资料哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22eab9f13fd29e4ee67942df4bec3eafe34a1f0bf7b552f0c169a0baed083b31",
      "text": "那个难道是，前阵子信玄先生\n在事务所分发的特训菜单吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7cb51493a776ce67d9933c7528a9f66ca3c53ffa569e42345be7e1708c09e65",
      "text": "答对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81af3900a425297fd43dd1c74d176b41c464837567b7dd1ab14ec7fc142e7159",
      "text": "内容都是根据每个人的优势与不足定制的，\n趁这个机会，我们也多多进化吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dfa588f3524b821f1dc506bb15e078eaf8c69add15580ac04d0e4756a307600",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n哎呀，渡边先生。真巧呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdc2d0b03b6f17f51050a65c11f76c6942d5344d3084a017631d20330ede181b",
      "text": "北斗先生，辛苦了！我们都是刚忙完工作吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011642b65d175a4078afb77e20da47ace8969ede552f6bca221a30e05bd4d450",
      "text": "要不要一起稍微休息一下？\n我已经泡好咖啡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e652f93665c38563fcf688f824b0da5214b3bc3bec5cc6b3b9912f9c19606573",
      "text": "那可帮大忙了。我就不客气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20aed967d26361d2473b44019f9203f3fb2f6d221548a9cea00a547a10dc498b",
      "text": "说起来前阵子，\n冬马先生来找我们征求建议了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:932b9e56563af4db211e5f64db94b5efd68c17cf5abf59d22346c12266308c9a",
      "text": "说是因为要出演《成为万物的万人迷！》，\n想了解一下我们Beit的粉丝福利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8373a208355cf79c19df5c4295389bbbeb9b95f034d196ef09e3973ad7c6758a",
      "text": "是这样吗？\n冬马居然去向渡边先生他们请教，太狡猾了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73374aeff4978e5e7106e5d89b51d98e7a5489476b4f163e12b6e2fc355e370d",
      "text": "呵呵。虽然我也一样，不过大家都燃起来了呢。\n对男极联赛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5ab10ef53eced9e9cf7e6827aa58f09e5f1d7b128df4856c58ec6123b34174",
      "text": "是啊。\n整个事务所气氛都很高涨，看起来很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:906a7294a99d69fcea08ddeecaf7a3d549667fc4e3f88e0d3a3f5a21bc83875a",
      "text": "北斗先生没有燃起来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d36fb8b93a62be562e9f0432289be2269a0d1e55ba7ff813be254cce16466f",
      "text": "……因为这里全是充满热情的人啊。\n我觉得那股热情好像也传染给我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8c36436c09e14b83700940d0c7c264c2b72b3a65965afafa40c4d598838c94",
      "text": "确实如此呢。\n大家都是珍贵而无可替代的伙伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efcb6c7a69fa17ed5231cef59972b5c1dec154d75d8c2446add4976ee6aba3e2",
      "text": "……对渡边先生来说，珍视的事物\n和为之倾注心血的事物真的很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72bf37d79e06b7b1f8cc124db89b3b6ed164320a526e50fbccc43e82e85942f1",
      "text": "老实说，我觉得非常有意思。\n所以，我能问一个稍微有点刁钻的问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659f75c06a088b900303eaecfbf1bfefa80398149cc11acb42a27239b5c824c8",
      "text": "对渡边先生来说，不重要的东西……\n比如，讨厌的人之类的，难道就不存在吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe9905178f7ab8b9733b5b09a44c3ffed39767c14ebab1cdb8b01e8d751d0b7",
      "text": "这个嘛……我之所以珍视“大家”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0489f1976a89147a4683e795508b261e32d4500e79ef00f8a80e8ac7bd5737",
      "text": "……这或许意味着，我并没有真正去\n理解对方呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9142d4d83d43858292160e5e3696816410728a1d3034bb92c43c81cb9b75912a",
      "text": "我并不觉得这是坏事哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:032884356dce1f12bf9b33357207cb0aa805229989c55bd10c5a42d2421e62eb",
      "text": "因为去理解、试图去理解对方，\n有时反而会产生问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284511b300136b74a7ab988c8598b236e48ff0e5fb1856e4c0e6cc19ce7a168e",
      "text": "以为心意相通结果只是误会，\n想要去贴近却遭到了拒绝……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a1951d86e7ca2abbaf3e52839a6e4474a6c11d0ddfac1460f2ed0cbfab2147",
      "text": "（……即使长久陪伴在身边，\n有时也会在一无所知的情况下面临离别）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11438484ea317b5ba03a633cb6858b9b5dcae67c76fa3f285f8856c11f045a9a",
      "text": "即使如此，换作渡边先生的话……\n还是会想要真正去理解别人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b134bd44bc9b1a00a6fd3703af1b78a09b00f06f25000d563338f3dc766d011",
      "text": "那个嘛……\n如果你希望我去理解的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb70a974bcb9778b521f1060c4d24628e3f1cf4dcde9966c1b89470ebcb7110",
      "text": "那么，我大概会想要尝试去理解吧。\n所以，我想听听北斗先生是怎么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:067f5ff1c7d80f7eb1d11ce1c6bd27ad11fb0adc7b1b8170da1957ca6f8c05d3",
      "text": "……\n呵呵，真是赢不过渡边先生啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2213efe2e277a5b6189b3524abeb31ad74e868f02915d7b67ee3c3a65d31726e",
      "text": "是很刁钻的问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b91ed254d86bfe1cf4cc95178157f64426716980be598bc10c64927941c339d",
      "text": "是啊，有一点。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641ffae9892d34b16ec14e377148fa297551ed6eeff689111fcb919283432b2b",
      "text": "自己到底想怎么做……我想在这里，\n多多发掘出那样的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974fd228790346c1d815f3e0cf80fd1d91884e63becb67a8ec3070ca38f75e59",
      "text": "无论多少次、无论有多少都能找到的。\n因为315 Pro就是这样的地方啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e52c366c363fda5a46db10c90977d4dbb98f0bea010be2bb52d5525126284a",
      "text": "是啊。\n毕竟这里有许多像您这样出色的大人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c99ebd2bc4c0fb20d4aa4ea4ca4e88cf2c18185005eb8f7023617054520fb1",
      "text": "《成为万物的万人迷！》录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72dfd53f8e7864ef259d3d5907f46041a9ddfa34c03998ac1e85bb8b8b67108a",
      "text": "好，《成为万物的万人迷！》正式开始了！\n本次出演的偶像是Jupiter的三位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcfcade3cc5c09d06d02fe05ff074478df39c7ea8949674e70381f0e27af751f",
      "text": "三位将要撩台下的男女老少观众，\n争夺谁才是真正的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b60998f834f194024afc07be0ca11e57fca017bbb753123bbbbbfc46aa83eb",
      "text": "那套西装穿得笔挺，真帅气。\n超级适合您哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb60dd1bc51188040c50ec11b7b3f5077be954db1b191db557ab1535587d3d9",
      "text": "能再多聊聊吗？\n和您的交谈，真的非常愉快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1ec0e327a11323c8a2f23267c820f11f7a2e09bc9280a935b03877cc971a7a",
      "text": "哇……大姐姐好时尚啊！\n也能教教我时尚的诀窍吗～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000099:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e2ddd5810334360adf568845ca28812512fb6bab32a63d6196a2e783e71873",
      "text": "前半场结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb0a13d2a86b6f49b744b24aa0eefaad0458aebe1d31537c5ec65fd74f2c113",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！\n前半场的排名结果已经出来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ffa65823dd72a87dbed37dbb3569ce488fe29013c7194f0cc88b619b9483912",
      "text": "哦，快让我看看！……诶，北斗是最后一名！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea43f92c73a29b4f81f6042bf7e69513f930a70c8b303d9646d2e37cdf5cde27",
      "text": "哎～真意外啊～。\n我还以为冬马君肯定是最后一名呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e829de5043a45de41fbd7a75fdbe5c26f4bc921677dd831fb4f8943f404dbae",
      "text": "我也……等等，为什么啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f984e241d36b24a524c6ad5c5c0516538aaccb25ac786c6b97f3da1a2c358459",
      "text": "因为你跟女孩子搭话的时候超害羞的嘛。\n在旁边看着我都觉得难为情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8b5b40e5a7804de3ac5c299273a2b9bde4f1955cbcff39276188f6692d9835f",
      "text": "不过，有评论说“这一点很可爱”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff92280f17c25f9e0fb71948d738360a86a5079173bb22e42432eefe0f32f02a",
      "text": "那么，给我的评论是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1563b58fc0a4c6b9555d6662951e86e23cecda2654d782cbb3a633270d52323",
      "text": "“帅过头了反而让人难以接近（30多岁男性）”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e34bd8694bc96b59b7eee6e9fd5993d489e43e724aeccf1a01aa172f9c0073b9",
      "text": "“感觉就算我不投他也能拿第一名……\n（20多岁女性）”，是这样的评论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:446f1badc6f260e4190986e350847bde1a88667e9a40670aab7eb5b0c0713d4e",
      "text": "天使酱和天使君的\n心思还真是复杂呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c323f39e0ec47d9c06d06fefd4e6b90e8f25943015bc0dc8d2d33778df4b1b8f",
      "text": "不过，我已经找到解决办法了。\n冬马、翔太，我马上就会反超你们的，做好心理准备吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7927ba189c4bd3c00721f385196de7935e9c5996ed2430c62be9cd33f262a194",
      "text": "哟，口气倒挺大。\n我也不会输的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f99c4b076363791150c52ed02b5569c298e15b6723ef8b7d86b50eda544db2e9",
      "text": "哎呀呀，两个人都热血上头了。\n嘛，赢的当然会是我就是了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000061:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950a703e3f69b8cb4f1207537ac6fd33126a9cd70f9c0ea2d460b62d21a6c898",
      "text": "后半场开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6430a5eff3849be5b639d68e59203119d6f7a3d8f4efbf12e76cf9d675ef62f",
      "text": "……确实，很多人都夸我很迷人。\n但是，我只想听你亲口对我说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c64d91a5da7f9744d72394f55550072d9cef23128fe2f6c8ef654f8576d8f12",
      "text": "哇，那是什么表情啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a07f37c243f99357e20cbc61bb160293aa01f5c809d7f3f80be172b49b9c287",
      "text": "那个略带忧伤的表情杀伤力超大呢……\n北斗君的排名也一口气追上来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d26e2a6becda56aa7f02067a086876c888b89fa87353d72b0107a73e2ecb1a",
      "text": "可恶，后半场还没结束呢。\n胜负现在才刚刚开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc037364ea67d84d08662cb4d354d11e478304ff72d96252d17893cac540bf7a",
      "text": "后半场结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f549a5e31fe3c529f3f1cb2c891601ea53e1c6766c8ccc67e43e5870e8bfa08",
      "text": "录制演播厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0f98a92b02db01671e6ebca5f47361596e680dbeecb8c151dd7cd208336a06",
      "text": "出来了吗，后半场的结果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:930aafdd8e50588594f0d91806088cdecd1c46eec50acd2b20a1db6847c56708",
      "text": "虽然差距很小，但北斗先生目前是第一名。\n胜负将由接下来的最终决战来定夺！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79341acda028dd10ecbe8757d90c600695174bb06b6d460f052e0137ea2df696",
      "text": "去撩工作人员那台进水报废的智能手机就可以了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3579d7c75e6b5f7364d6ae8a8a57b432fca2b16263254573d1f10bf708d685",
      "text": "嗯。这次不是人类，而是对万物代表的\n智能手机搭话后，按下电源键……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b3602007beceb669b5d960b321a8403c65c064bf1e36c9bbb766bc754ec195",
      "text": "如果顺利开机，就算作“回应了自己的呼唤”，\n追加10000pt！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203b12aaa607a4e24616070a4b1c0f05efb70972790c670c6df455b0dca0ff26",
      "text": "不管对手是智能手机还是什么都无所谓。\n让它开机的人，绝对会是我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c86f745751e124ae84a97ea629e5fa7b068cf4f17cc673342423bfe19e04e1e",
      "text": "虽然搞不太懂为什么这样就能决定谁是万人迷，\n不过都走到这一步了，怎么可能输呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036ca581b143e71b230c1e71f5a79a776649a5751970ba74070c0f8c09a294be",
      "text": "不管对方是什么，我也不觉得自己会输呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4775af1dafab999a840b25aad3b235675a17473c0f59f3b64e506c8d79ccde9d",
      "text": "挑战顺序依次是冬马先生、北斗先生、翔太先生。\n大家请加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c33739c98c44282714bf00a1901e327fa07cbb3d9bde6fd144cdf48db5571c2",
      "text": "最终决战开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08d528e0e859caccba22e2b0f86294283a59f2812dd0592333b65498a03c6dc",
      "text": "怎么会变成这样啊……没有你\n可不行啊。让我听听你的声音吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f473fa90b68906d29858122612fc6ee95735cc4133039c464bc9c1bc7882e9",
      "text": "毫无反应啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:840f3debfba6dee3a587f865f34cdcb0fff41bee5a5313aa07629953c52d66ec",
      "text": "真是个坏孩子呢。差不多该起床了。\n让我再看看你那耀眼的表情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:231d8a1b06dd1e9dc871d2a80317b14b0e9467b322c3756d0a436ae6b9037341",
      "text": "真遗憾……看来我不行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00c13cfb24beb5bd32a6e0ca633d37fce770b8e3e5ca40c521348cb0b3c852b8",
      "text": "真是的，打算睡到什么时候啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3e737d314909ce9831b41cf1578d5347009da0f6be17cad6a83bec12cde78a8",
      "text": "要是你不起床的话，\n我明天开始也不起床了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b20d0bdf2c5151ef301ed5292e4affe77541004a6bbd8bf778269db89db872",
      "text": "唰——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd814533353e0cba2666f64b519bd3daee6a2b1e0f0f4acc4da81535362bad2",
      "text": "啊，亮了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98bcd6ef40e29716a003a99a74681213c173fc6763cbed93ae113fa870449716",
      "text": "也就是说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11378564b4847451741492f632bf372ffd2707f8099cd6d4f232c9262b9e1508",
      "text": "证明了翔太受万物欢迎呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63817ca6b98b89ca2f866d93433d7785fc133f4a04752b4299af16085bf7c1c9",
      "text": "不愧是深受大家喜爱的国民弟弟偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063e86860f13fd8a99b9f71bafeddc65369bcc8d1fc07337ff5ac451575fcda2",
      "text": "我明明自主练习了那么久的……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1cf6545977a08f2c6ed87255f028fbf4800188a07b1a47de793968034508883",
      "text": "诶——……这和练习有关系吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7dd7237c66909270622dcf775bd3eaf2d82da9681d6c2f1c277c82e35c4944c",
      "text": "不过，运气也是实力的一部分嘛♪\n这次果然还是我赢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000147:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000162:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12d002fc93c47471b55afb0c7ba1d61945f14f9c79b35867f8599131b061a57d",
      "text": "那个万物的万人迷，\n我出场的那期是下周啊。\n今天可别看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000164:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc63c43c99caa69859e9d64c5540fdaa03eb4118dadea5f4edb88d37ff67ef10",
      "text": "冬马？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6e32999cd54d67eb60a8eb3f07b59f8225408c1fb98daf41d6ee5fdaf9a5f2",
      "text": "不是下周\n是今天哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc5a4d3d82f7e15792959dc661538ae0e541ce66494516f5c9cfd9cd3308494d",
      "text": "啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d22b15d4364f9b2866e995f63348e9447d3a49a1670048f339a6128045455c",
      "text": "，刚才",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bea923529fd84a0472cb6232b11f91ac2cec86d4167652fc49d06460a403c037",
      "text": "啊——我知道了！\n是不小心发错人\n了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a03788d49eae9c3dc3b7992dadc545fb664602562c1a95c27ec70ae137e461",
      "text": "对方是学校的朋友吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b8a9121a567a94759eafcc33fda3d332b92ce5ae9554d1b6a145a45b4cd6ca",
      "text": "冬马君真是的，\n因为觉得被看到很害羞\n所以想撒谎！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c128578906daec3c1c2772946e149abcff38bae38f041d7cd339db5b686505",
      "text": "毕竟冬马撩女性的姿态\n很难得一见嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffc68f745a7c3c7326b1e48cfc20fcda28c3f3350baa0f5245528b80f7142fc3",
      "text": "站在我的角度，觉得大家看看\n会比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000182:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f7891ea753c193653d4ceb1908982958b7603ab055031cc1cc8b781f48b61f",
      "text": "赞成您的看法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000182:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ff49c78cf313a73536f4768016893c055f4ae934dd89579c108a894b690e0f",
      "text": "我也持相同意见。\n冬马先生努力的样子，\n非常帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000183:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b65c4aaac7c75bd18c9807a3e17899d79a3dd9448e8e1f4ea68be3d1b7a1e02",
      "text": "很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000183:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e58c6079251624fc5f52fb20e967195a1e4e606a559e6ec97993cc1ce4e3f3",
      "text": "冬马先生认真的样子，\n真的很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7f0edd7fb8e18bde8ce30e2d4c9f3ebd63a3a96f8a2182fa36a3416495cde99",
      "text": "就是说嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_j:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07b03a101de00bfa7c9aee9195d177022912100bb6940503ef283ee702618a63",
      "text": "冬马君认真的态度\n明明就很帅气<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>\n就让他们看看嘛<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
